  "abstract": "<jats:p>We demonstrate the first fully integrated 1064 nm GaAs-on-TFLN transmitter combining widely tunable GaAs lasers with &gt;100 GHz thin-film lithium niobate modulators. The device achieves 100 Gb/s NRZ and 160 Gb/s PAM4 transmission.</jats:p>",
